    "attributes": {
        "action": "Abolish early release for sex offenders and murderers",
        "additional_details": "I live with my trauma every day, so I do not believe that serious offenders should be allowed to leave prison early.",
        "background": "I am a survivor of serious sexual abuse as a child and was raped as an adult. I would like the Government to change the law where anyone sentenced for rape or murder should not be eligible for early release on licence.",
